From e8c837110f4faeea7ac7763817e98e68f00cb803 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 13:48:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(pub_api): serve a part's ezPLM symbol / footprint / 3D
 files to partners

- GET /api/pub/v1/parts/{id}/cad/{symbol|footprint|model}: signed, counted as a part
  detail; .kicad_sym (with its root symbol), .kicad_mod and the footprint's .step from
  ezPLM's own library (downloaded and cached as for the admin preview); fields with a
  pending conflict are never served; 404 when ezPLM's library has no file
- part detail carries ezplm_library {symbol, footprint, model} availability
- previews: ezplm_symbol_lib / ezplm_footprint_by_name shared by preview and API

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018MWFKK7DmS3uJmhqWTQfJ4
---
