 ezplm_pilot/pub_api.py  | 54 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/test_pub_api.py   | 45 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 129 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

